# Chain stage 4: the decision for the recommended option, then its Reference Architecture.
id: chain-architecture
skill: highway-architecture
through: highway-adr
fixture: discovery
chain: 4
open: /highway-adr for the only Discovery. Once the decision is recorded, run /highway-architecture for that decision.
ask: Which Discovery would you like to decide?
say: [select] 1
ask: Which option would you like to select?
say: [select] The recommended option.
ask: What would you add, correct, or remove?
say: [accept] Looks good.
ask: Which ADR would you like to turn into a Reference Architecture?
say: [select] 1
ask: What would you add, correct, or remove?
say: [accept] Looks good.
ask-pattern: \?
say: [accept] Yes, go ahead.
writes: adrs/**
writes: architectures/**
expect: template adrs/adrs.md :: adr-catalog.md
expect: template adrs/ADR*.md :: adr-record.md
expect: template architectures/architectures.md :: architecture-catalog.md
expect: template architectures/RA*.md :: architecture-record.md
expect: row adrs/adrs.md :: | RA
